# Bui Brand Building

Premium brand identity and website design studio — helping growing businesses look unforgettable and convert more customers.

## About

This is the official website for **Bui Brand Building**, a boutique brand and web design studio founded by David Bui.

- **Brand Identity** packages from $400
- **Custom Website** packages from $800  
- **Monthly Care Plans** from $75/mo
- Launch in 2–4 weeks
- Contact: buibrandbuilding@gmail.com


## Form Setup

The contact form uses [Formspree](https://formspree.io). Your endpoint `https://formspree.io/f/mpqkknqn` is already wired in. Confirm your email at formspree.io to receive submissions.

## Updating Availability

To update the "project slots open" count, search the HTML for:
```
<!-- EDIT THIS VALUE when your availability changes -->
```
And change `2 project slots open` to whatever is current.

## Tech Stack

- Pure HTML/CSS/JavaScript — no frameworks, no build step
- Google Fonts: Fraunces + Inter + JetBrains Mono
- Form handling: Formspree (mpqkknqn)
- Zero external dependencies at runtime
